<title>SPAIN: Union Fenosa Q1 gp net up 1.8 pct - agency.</title>
<headline>Union Fenosa Q1 gp net up 1.8 pct - agency.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Union Fenosa first-quarter group net was 11.24 billion pesetas, up 1.8 percent from the year-ago period, Spanish news agency Europa Press said, citing company sources.</p>
<p>The utility firm said there was no one immediately available to confirm the results.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
